## Rules

- Prod browser/mobile smoke by **Cursor / Cloud Agents** → founder QA secrets above unless the task names another approved account.
- **Forbidden by default:** App Store review account (Anna) and [`docs/app-store-demo-konto.md`](../docs/app-store-demo-konto.md) except explicit store/release tasks.
- Do not invent new prod test users when the founder account suffices.
- Do not delete Astrid or run destructive tests without explicit founder approval.

